{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI am willing to give everything to become the protagonist in your story, even if I am the ANTAGONIST in the script.\u201d</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/extras/a80478696d4280472c56301b84c06ae8.avif?t=1760941426\" width=472 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned Ansel and Greta follow the sweet aroma to the candy house. Strangely, although the candy house appears full of wonderful things, it is permeated by an eerie atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two encounter a moody doll, playful and mischievous teddy bears, elusive gingerbread twins, and a witch shrouded in mystery... The sweets here not only satisfy hunger but are also key to unraveling the many mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Develop recipes, collect ingredients</strong></i>, create various magical sweets, and record them in the <i><strong>dessert book</strong></i>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sweets can be used as weapons, increase intelligence, even change form, and can attract mysterious creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step they take is fraught with danger, and <i><strong>every choice they make will alter the course of the story.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can Hansel and Gretel uncover the dark conspiracies hidden beneath the sweet sugar coating?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1788060?t=1760941426","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760941426","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/77a88093b8f5f7045b41684e0534576de638a55f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760941426","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/77a88093b8f5f7045b41684e0534576de638a55f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760941426","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Commentary available","id":14},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI am willing to give everything to become the protagonist in your story, even if I am the ANTAGONIST in the script.\u201d</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1788060/extras/a80478696d4280472c56301b84c06ae8.avif?t=1760941426\" width=472 height=108 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abandoned Ansel and Greta follow the sweet aroma to the candy house. Strangely, although the candy house appears full of wonderful things, it is permeated by an eerie atmosphere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The two encounter a moody doll, playful and mischievous teddy bears, elusive gingerbread twins, and a witch shrouded in mystery... The sweets here not only satisfy hunger but are also key to unraveling the many mysteries. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Develop recipes, collect ingredients</strong></i>, create various magical sweets, and record them in the <i><strong>dessert book</strong></i>! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some sweets can be used as weapons, increase intelligence, even change form, and can attract mysterious creatures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step they take is fraught with danger, and <i><strong>every choice they make will alter the course of the story.</strong></i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr